                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5f3fcf2-9612-4026-8a02-5c7761bed2be",
                                "sense_id": "36fb3f5a-e18b-30e9-a5d7-4b886b2a3aa2",
                                "text": "In Brazil I have often admired the varied beauty of the bananas, palms, and orange-trees contrasted together; and here we also have the bread-fruit, conspicuous from its large, glossy, and deeply digitated leaf."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fcb7e1ec-5e4a-41db-9a85-3211b301f381",
                                "sense_id": "36fb3f5a-e18b-30e9-a5d7-4b886b2a3aa2",
                                "text": "The other pair of limbs terminate in something that, from the single instance I experienced, seemed to resemble soft but firm antennae or, perhaps, digitated palpi--\" \"Feelers!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87e5d98d-c4a7-4cf8-aed5-bf0502d58df0",
                                "sense_id": "36fb3f5a-e18b-30e9-a5d7-4b886b2a3aa2",
                                "text": "From the large digitated leaves an extract is made which has proved of service in whooping-cough, and of which from one-third to half a teaspoonful may be given for a dose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e2f55bd8-43e3-4987-bf02-8752817647de",
                                "sense_id": "36fb3f5a-e18b-30e9-a5d7-4b886b2a3aa2",
                                "text": "Its massive central mountain, surmounted by many peaks, occupies a considerable area on the floor, and exhibits a digitated outline at the base."
